Package: openalexStandard
Title: Check Packages and Corpora Against the openalexPro Ecosystem Standard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Rainer M.", "Krug", , "Rainer.Krug@sib.swiss", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7490-0066"))
Description: Checks R packages and Parquet corpora against STANDARD.md of the
    openalexPro ecosystem (corpus layout, works schema, provenance files,
    identifiers, link table, package requirements) and writes compliance
    reports. Used in package tests and by the ecosystem's compliance workflow.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/openalexPro/openalexPro_Ecosystem
BugReports: https://github.com/openalexPro/openalexPro_Ecosystem/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.5)
Imports:
    DBI,
    duckdb,
    jsonlite,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    openalexAPI,
    pkgload,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/openalexPro/standard: 0.1
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
